From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Knowable Labs <knowl@knowl.invalid>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:58:51 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] webapp: Delete Topic in place of Leave, and no status
 in the account menu

Leaving a Topic already stops its team and takes it from the person's list, and
nobody can add them back, so the action is named for what it does: Delete, with
a confirmation that says so. The account menu keeps the name, the profile and
signing out; a person's availability has no reader in a workspace of agents.

docs/guides/agent-workspace-design.md, Workspace controls.
